imate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mine is Tremere and Saulot have merged. The Worm is actually Kupala.<br /> <br /> Kupala has also tried to take over Tzimisce but failed due to Tzimisce becoming an enormous hive minded-god thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>My thought is that the worm is Saulot &quot;purging&quot; the Tzimisce blood from his system.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24575-raunalyn","name":"Raunalyn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-04T06:53:21-08:00","id":1352591,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vysha</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1352276-crazy-and-mundane-headcanons-for-v5?p=1352365#post1352365\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Silly stuff? Oh, I have some silly stuff for you.<br /> <br /> ~A conversation came up at the table about which vampire, mage, werewolf, mummy, changeling, ghost or whatever controls the president, if any. In the end, it was decided that the president is controlled by three vampires, a half dozen technocrats, a single lonely BSD, two different demons, at least seventeen psychics, and between one and fifteen changelings. Each one's control cancels out the others', leaving the president fully under his own wits and control. This has been the state of affairs since the late 60s, for every president in office. This has since become canon in my game.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nah, I think it's a Tzimisce of some type. It's the hair, you see? Look at his hair, then look at Boris Johnson's hair. I'm telling you, those fiends know what they're doing...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24575,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24575-raunalyn","user":"Raunalyn","date":". 12-04-2019, 09:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24575-raunalyn","name":"Raunalyn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-04T06:56:09-08:00","id":1352592,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Justycar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1352276-crazy-and-mundane-headcanons-for-v5?p=1352413#post1352413\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1 Isaac Abrahams is the producer of Twilight.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ye Gods, that makes him the most evil of all of the Vampires in existence!! Even the Antedilluvians pale in comparison!!!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24575-raunalyn","name":"Raunalyn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-04T06:59:02-08:0