tps://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-04T11:05:37-08:00","id":1352646,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1352276-crazy-and-mundane-headcanons-for-v5?p=1352643#post1352643\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Some of the material reads that Uncle Augie is already in the Shadowlands at least, so Dis Pater might have brought Augustus to himself already.</div> </div> </div> </div>One of the things I am considering in my current chronicle is that Cappie's Spectre has taken over Augie's body and is actively working to bring Oblivion to the skin lands.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24575-raunalyn","name":"Raunalyn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-04T12:15:11-08:00","id":1352658,"title":"","content":"My headcanon is that Augustus Giovanni has been sealed in a coffin belonging to one of the Apostles and is now buried under the Vatican. Presumably to Indiana Jones music.<br /> <br /> Now is that a GOOD thing or a BAD thing?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-04T14:01:05-08:00","id":1352673,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1352276-crazy-and-mundane-headcanons-for-v5?p=1352658#post1352658\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">. Presumably to Indiana Jones music.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, Beckett locked him up and stuck him under the Vatican?<br /> <br /> Lucita was born Lucida Dulcia, the product of an affair between her father (Alfonso II) and a dark-haired noble woman. After his formal marriage, she became a problem in terms of appearances and status. So, influenced by Moncada, her father bundled her off to a nunnery, where the old vampire embraced her. Believing his first daughter to be dead - and technically being correct - Alfonso named his last daughter after his first, Dulcia. Lately, Lucita herself has assumed control of a Loyalist (i.e. freedom minded) remnant of the Sabbat in the wake of the S.I. and the Gehenna War.<br /> <br /> Beckett was captured by one section of the SI or another. They consider him to be a valuable prisoner, and are interrogating him for information. He is being held in the as some other high-profile bits of business, including the Goratrix Mirror, and some Tzimisce freak-show.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-04T15:07:40-08:00","id":1352681,"title":"","content":"Nephilim were the Damphyr children of Zillah and a Fallen.<br /> The crooked man is a Nosferatu kindred society has forgotten due to Obfuscate. The crooked man sold out the Cainites of Scotland to Mithras for a favour. The bent coin and the poem are a reminder of the debt.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":769,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/769-chris-wilson","user":"Chris Wilson","date":".  Changed Obten to Obfuscate 12-04-2019, 06:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/769-chris-wilson","name":"Chris Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-07T20:50:40-08:00","id":1353485,"title":"","content":"In my chronicle, I'm gonna decide that the Lasombra actually DID succeeded in killing their antediluvian back in the Renaissance, and that Cappadocius, Set and the Ravnos antediluvian are also, truly dead. Consequently, though they don't really understand why, elders of their clans don't hear the Beckoning. The effect of this on the setting is relatively minor, as the Ravnos elders are almost extinct and the bulk of the elder Setites are already in the Middle East anyhow, and the Harbingers and the Lasombra were mostly in the Sabbat, and went off to fight the Gehenna War regardless. But it will have something of an impact in my Mexico City chronicle, were several old Lasombra remained behind to guard Sabbat assets, and the Lasombra antitribu will suddenly become a bit of a stronger faction in the Camarilla. This creates, I think, a cool, dynamic imbalance in the setting, and a little bit of a mystery to boot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24830-natsymir","name":"Natsymir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-08T20:11:11-08:00","id":1353685,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Natsymir</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1352276-crazy-and-mundane-headcanons-for-v5?p=1353485#post1353485\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In my chronicle, I'm gonna decide that the Lasombra actually DID succeeded in killing their antediluvian back in the Renaissance, and that Cappadocius, Set and the Ravnos antediluvian are also, truly dead. Consequently, though they don't really understand why, elders of their clans don't hear the Beckoning. The effect of this on the setting is relatively minor, as the Ravnos elders are almost extinct and the bulk of the elder Setites are already in the Middle East anyhow, and the Harbingers and the Lasombra were mostly in the Sabbat, and went off to fight the Gehenna War regardless. But it will have something of an impact in my Mexico City chronicle, were several old Lasombra remained behind to guard Sabbat assets, and the Lasombra antitribu will suddenly become a bit of a stronger faction in the Camarilla. This creates, I think, a cool, dynamic imbalance in the setting, and a little bit of a mystery to boot.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oooo, nice one!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-08T20:40:08-08:00","id":1353687,"title":"","content":"<b>Sex, Sexuality, and Blood</b><br /> <br /> These are just some flavor rules for my games. Warning - for immature audiences only.<br /> <br /> + Most vampires gradually start to become pansexual due to the fact Feeding and Sex are intrinsically linked in their minds. Some vampires remain either strongly heterosexual or homosexual but this is due to personal identity that most discard with time. Asexual vampires feel the Hunger as something as a wholly alien desire.<br /> <br /> + All vampires are physically capable of sex with the Blush of Life and enjoy it if they're so inclined to do so in life. However, the experience of sex pales to the feeding and most find sex without feeding unsatisfying.<br /> <br /> + Vampires are capable of ghouling through their use of fluids during sex. This is one of the few &quot;covert&quot; means of ghouling or blood bonding someone.<br /> <br /> + The Kiss is magical in nature and prevents the body's blood from spilling out in arterial spray. A vampire can feed extremely fast or extremely slowly by controlling it via their body's innate magic. It's why every feeding from the neck or thigh doesn't kill a subject.<br /> <br /> + The Kiss knocks away roughly five-to-ten minutes of a subject's memory after they're fed on. They tend to fill in the blanks themselves on the circumstances they find themselves ranging from being naked in a bed, alone in a bathroom, or just having zoned out.<br /> <br /> + The Kiss is incredibly pleasurable and equivalent to a lengthy orgasm. If they do remember it, subjects very often let themselves be fed on the same way they'd want regular great sex. It is not hard to addict subjects to it. What they think is happening often depends on the vampire setting it up.<br /> <br /> + Feeding is like blood and sex for vampires combined and every night you feed, it is a rush that justifies unliving another night.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-08T22:13:13-08:00","id":1353700,"title":"","content":"I have to politely disagree about the sexuality.<br /> <br /> Newly made vampires may attempt sex, and try to cling to the human sexuality, to avoid the Beast. But it will not work. On a good day it will be like when a vampire drinks alcohol for fake being human, only to later have to spit up the alcohol.<br /> <br /> Most vampires quickly come to seeing sexuality as simply a tool for controlling others. They enjoy it in the same way someone might enjoy cleaning the house or some other chore. But they can lie and fake it, as a part of manipulating other people.<br /> <br /> The Kiss can cause people to have blackouts, but does not produce pleasure in a mortal.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1208,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","user":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","date":". 12-09-2019, 01:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-08T22:16:34-08:00","id":1353702,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1352276-crazy-and-mundane-headcanons-for-v5?p=1353700#post1353700\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have to politely disagree about the sexuality.<br /> <br /> Newly made vampires may attempt sex, and try to cling to the human sexuality, to avoid the Beast. But it will not work. On a good day it will be like when a vampire drinks alcohol for fake being human, only to later have to spit up the alcohol.<br /> <br /> Most vampires quickly come to seeing sexuality as simply a tool for controlling others. They enjoy it in the same way someone might enjoy cleaning the house or some other chore. But they can lie and fake it, as a part of manipulating other people.<br /> <br /> The Kiss can cause people to have blackouts, but does not produce pleasure in a mortal.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, very different takes. The only people whose Kiss doesn't cause pleasure in my games is the Giovanni and it's an enormous flaw.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-08T23:45:37-08:00","id":1353716,"title":"","content":"-Vampires feel attraction to healthy seeming vessels, because the blood is likely better stuff. My headcannon is that vampires gain Attributes not by training, but by feeding on people with good (3-5) attributes that are either better than their own or perhaps have some quality they lack in their own attributes (a different kind of intellegence...) Virtues are 50/50, talents are 70/30. Skills and knowledges are 80/90% learnt and 20/10% parasitic. There'd be more impressive people in the world if vampires weren't sapping their potential.<br /> I'd say good looks are a health signifier, but sexual promiscuity mitigates that with disease potential.<br /> <br /> -Sex makes vampires feel good for the power dynamic/ego/humanity connection rather than the physical side of things. It feels about as good as a backrub unless your humanity is high, you use a ritual or maybe you pump some extra blood.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-09T15:56:14-08:00","id":1353985,"title":"","content":"I could see seducing attractive targets being a power thing for a great many vampires, with some even evolving their own preferences as beauty standards change over the decades.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-09T21:11:58-08:00","id":1354058,"title":"","content":"<b>Chicago by Night 5E Headcanon</b><br /> <br /> I'm going for the funny and inconsequential here rather than elite.<br /> <br /> <b>Camarilla</b><br /> <br /> * Kevin Jackson shaves his head every night because he HATES the fact he's stuck with a 90s Kid and Play-looking haircut, complete with dollar sign.<br /> <br /> * Nero attempted to Embrace Lindsay Sterling. Kathy Glens just barely stopped him.<br /> <br /> * Alan Sovereign claims he visits the Succubus Club and Red 6 to maintain ties to younger Kindred. In fact, he is addicted to hip hop and metal.<br /> <br /> * Damien talks like an old man about the Anarchs, mocking them as only an Ex-Goth, Ex-Punk.<br /> <br /> * Helena doesn't admit it but pretty much prefers to live as Portia and be a perpetual party girl than she does a 3000 year old methuselah.<br /> <br /> * Critias has an insane amount of nastiness to say about the female Doctor on Doctor Who. It has offended many of his students and alienated what few Kindred also get it.<br /> <br /> <b>Anarchs</b><br /> <br /> * Anita Wainwright looks eerily like Sombra from Overwatch in her new identity and people assume she's cosplaying her.<br /> <br /> * Gerard is in love with Anita and she is completely oblivious to it.<br /> <br /> * Maldavis really dislikes Anita for the fact she considers herself an expert on black issues as well as the cause.<br /> <br /> * Duncan MacTavish is nicknamed Captain Price. Oddly enough, he gets it and approves.<br /> <br /> * Bobby Weatherbottom remains at the top of the hackers of the world because very little about hacking is actually technical, just socially done.<br /> <br /> * He is ADDICTED to Mr. Robot.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;q