eg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-09T22:20:19-08:00","id":1354067,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1352276-crazy-and-mundane-headcanons-for-v5?p=1354066#post1354066\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Even the purple bits?</div> </div> </div> </div><i>Especially</i> the purple bits.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-09T22:26:08-08:00","id":1354068,"title":"","content":"Well, we've got video of her dancing.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gbGp-jnDrG4\" data-code=\"gbGp-jnDrG4\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/gbGp-jnDrG4/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-09T22:50:43-08:00","id":1354069,"title":"","content":"<b>Some more Chicago bits</b><br /> <br /> * Modius secretly controls a number of Freemason lodges under the erroneous impression this gives him vast occult power.<br /> <br /> * A bunch of Chicago Order of Hermes members believe Modius is the most powerful vampire in the city due to his control over Freemason lodges.<br /> <br /> * Modius has discovered what a cellphone is and is devoted to the Angry Birds.<br /> <br /> * Allicia loves Daisy Ridley for her role in Murder on the Orient Express and has since gotten into &quot;The Star Wars&quot; because of her.<br /> <br /> * Bennet Steadman is utterly in love with Evelyn Stephens and has an equal amount of feeling for Maldavis. Both ignore him and it really annoys him as he's not used to being blown off by anyone.<br /> <br /> * Bennet's plans on betraying Adze and Erzulie are due to the fact he's not quite as comfortable with their &quot;lifestyle&quot; as most other vampires are. Kevin Jackson finds this irritating but is slowly leading him on to believe he'll receive Adze's former holdings.<br /> <br /> * The song &quot;Stagger Lee&quot; is about Adze. Sweetie Pepper loves it.<br /> <br /> * Malkavians have been known to hear the Shaft theme play whenever Adze enters a room. Indeed, in Chicago it is quite common for many Kindred to have theme music in the Cobweb.<br /> <br /> * Crook was inspired to make his bars by imagining a Long John Silvers you could drink at. Only in Chicago would this work.<br /> <br /> * Thea Noel MacCraine has been on &quot;The Real Princesses of Chicago&quot; and has been invited back to do a follow-up due to her insane catty behavior. She's a favorite due to the allusions to Satanism, orgies, and drugs that were from before she was a Ministry member.<br /> <br /> * Noah &quot;Flyboy&quot; Grewal is immune to Presence. This has utterly confused and fascinated Helena. His ambivalence to her charms is like catnip. I mean, she's still one of the most beautiful women in the world but Noah generally prefers women who aren't &quot;skinny ass white girls.&quot;<br /> <br /> * Olaf One Eye is a Vicissitude-sculpted Jan Pieterszoon Dominated into thinking he's ANOTHER famous presumed-dead Ventrue, placed there by Vykos to hide him in what is an incredibly convoluted or just simply sadistic plan.<br /> <br /> * Kevin Jackson actually hates rap, R&amp;B, and hip hop. He considers this factoid something that is genuinely dangerous to come out to his followers. Even more dangerous is his love of country. The only clue to this is his cellphone full of Nashville hits and collection of Johnny Cash vinyl records.<br /> <br /> * Horatio Ballard is unaware of the horrifying and disgusting rumors about him spread by Son. He is a bastard, truly, but not THAT sort of sicko.<br /> <br /> * The curse of Billy the Goat on Wrigley Field was actually another example of Ballard's revenge. It being overcome was at great expense by the Anarchs.<br /> <br /> * Despite this, Ballard LOVES baseball and it is the one thing in the world that unironically brings out his jolly jovial side. Night games bring him out with a custom-made hat, pennant, and catcher's mitt.<br /> <br /> * Al Capone grew sick of being a gangster decades ago but knows image is everything among the Kindred. He actually made far more money with a money-laundering scheme's legitimate side in the 80s than he ever did on hooch and it's only grown since. It's ridiculous, really, but paid off. I mean, who the hell would buy <b>bottled water</b>?<br /> <br /> * Maxwell's mortal name was Jean Baptiste Point du Sable. As such, he REALLY has a claim to Chicago's Princedom: <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jean_Baptiste_Point_du_Sable\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jean_B...Point_du_Sable</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 12-10-2019, 02:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-10T16:28:35-08:00","id":1354263,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1352276-crazy-and-mundane-headcanons-for-v5?p=1354069#post1354069\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">* Kevin Jackson actually hates rap, R&amp;B, and hip hop. He considers this factoid something that is genuinely dangerous to come out to his followers. Even more dangerous is his love of country. The only clue to this is his cellphone full of Nashville hits and collection of Boxcar Willie 8-tracks.</div> </div> </div> </div>What? I'm helping!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-10T17:34:05-08:00","id":1354270,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Reasor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1352276-crazy-and-mundane-headcanons-for-v5?p=1354263#post1354263\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What? I'm helping!</div> </div> </div> </div>It was his influence that put Billy Ray Cyrus on Old Town Road. It was a cover, man! A cover!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-13T19:16:36-08:00","id":1354847,"title":"","content":"==posted something in the wrong thread, sorry===","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24830,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24830-natsymir","user":"Natsymir","date":". 12-13-2019, 10:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24830-natsymir","name":"Natsymir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-13T19:29:42-08:00","id":1354851,"title":"","content":"<b>Politics</b><br /> <br /> * Milwaukee is basically the Vietnam of the supernatural world (or Afghanistan) in that Princes and Barons send their troublemakers to the town with a &quot;letter of invitation&quot; to basically serve as cannon fodder against the Lupines. They generally die horribly in far larger numbers than the Garou themselves but it has been a losing proposition for them for decades as well.<br /> <br /> * The Sabbat as it used to be is about 10% of its previous size with half the Lasombra leaving, the Beckoning (that affects them to), the Gehenna War, Sabbat Civil War, Schism, Second Inquisition, and so on. It's gone from being the Soviet Union of the vampire world to being the North Korea. It is still dangerous, though.<br /> <br /> * The Wan Kuei are pretty much their own collection of Kindred clans with a lot of them trained in Spirit Thaumaturgy or Disciplines that allow them to manipulate spirit.<br /> <br /> * The Nagaraja are a major Clan there rather than a Bloodline and have no connection to the Euthantos. That's just a rumor they spread while manipulating the Black Hand.<br /> <br /> * House Carna planned to be Anarch but backed up on that with the fact the Council of Seven's destruction meant she could stay with the Camarilla and no one would go after her. The Anarchs think of this as a great betrayal and House Tremere is STILL determined to kill them all. It also hasn't helped her with the Lasombra or Banu Haqim.<br /> <br /> * The Ministry is...surprisingly at home with the Anarchs. They expected a bunch of stupid children and maybe that's what they found. Yet most of the Unbound are scared, angry, desperate, and used to oppression by the Ancients. It's familiar ground for the Ministry and some of them feel something akin but not identical to shame they didn't tend to these suffering masses' spiritual needs before.<br /> <br /> Many Anarchs, having not had much of a spiritual education before have found comfort in long-dead Roads or the Ministry's peculiar brand of mysticism. A lot of ex-Sabbat are already going, &quot;here we go again.&quot;<br /> <br /> * Orthodox Typhonism took a major hit with the overreaction of the Elders and some cunning moves by Kemintiri. Many of their leaders were Beckoned and their tyranny (in spite of being a religion about freedom) has resulted in it being marginalized as the primary faith.<br /> <br /> The fact that 9 out of 10 times a Mummy (many being former Osirians) hits the Setites that it's a Typhonist has also hurt them badly.<br /> <br /> * Hesha encountering Enoch's sarcophogus has destroyed his faith in Set since it means he's just another Antediluvian.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 12-13-2019, 10:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-13T19:39:52-08:00","id":1354852,"title":"","content":"Ye Gods, a Nagaraja Antedeluvian would be a thing of nightmare.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-13T19:50:04-08:00","id":1354853,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Reasor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1352276-crazy-and-mundane-headcanons-for-v5?p=1354852#post1354852\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ye Gods, a Nagaraja Antedeluvian would be a thing of nightmare.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nagaraja PC of mine: &quot;Yes, because taking the liquid part is that different.&quot;<br /> <br /> Brujah PC of a friend: &quot;Yes, they still have arms.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 12-14-2019, 07:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-13T23:24:54-08:00","id":1354858,"title":"","content":"<b>Ceoris</b><ul><li>The ruins of Ceoris are a destination on one of the <a href=\"https://romaniatourstore.com/store/romania-tours/dracula-tour-in-transylvania/\" target=\"_blank\">Dracula tours popular in Romania</a>. For purposes of the tour, the site is called the \u201c<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scholomance\" target=\"_blank\">Ruins of the Scholomance</a>.\u201d The ruins are physically located on a peninsula on the northern side of Lake Vidra. The tour company arranges mid-day picnics at the site, and never spends the night at the site \u2013 which is easier to get to by boat than by car. The tour company does pay people to dress in silly wizard costumes who stalk about, shouting things like \u201cHoary Host of Hoggoth\u201d and \u201clightening bolt lightening bolt lightening bolt!\u201d</li> <li>The Tzimisce think this is very funny.</li> <li>The Tremere do not think this is funny at all.</li> <li>However, the Tremere cannot shut the tours down because of interference from local vampires, mostly the Tzimisce, but also local Ventrue. Because \u201cFuck the Tremere, that\u2019s why.\u201d</li> <li>Because of the danger of a paradox the lich that dwells at the site usually spends its time in the local umbra or shadowlands. However, it can and will set up traps for any visiting vampires.</li> <li>The lich is probably Ponticulus, owing to shenanigans on part of the Yith, and their agents the True Brujah.</li> </ul><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-14T05:00:34-08:00","id":1354877,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1352276-crazy-and-mundane-headcanons-for-v5?p=1354858#post1354858\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Ceoris</b><ul><li>The ruins of Ceoris are a destination on one of the <a href=\"https://romaniatourstore.com/store/romania-tours/dracula-tour-in-transylvania/\" target=\"_blank\">Dracula tours popular in Romania</a>. For purposes of the tour, the site is called the \u201c<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scholomance\" target=\"_blank\">Ruins of the Scholomance</a>.\u201d The ruins are physically located on a peninsula on the northern side of Lake Vidra. The tour company arranges mid-day picnics at the site, and never spends the night at the site \u2013 which is easier to get to by boat than by car. The tour company does pay people to dress in silly wizard costumes who stalk about, shouting things like \u201cHoary Host of Hoggoth\u201d and \u201clightening bolt lightening bolt lightening bolt!\u201d</li> <li>The Tzimisce think this is very funny.</li> <li>The Tremere do not think this is funny at all.</li> <li>However, the Tremere cannot shut the tours down because of interference from local vampires, mostly the Tzimisce, but also local Ventrue. Because \u201cFuck the Tremere, that\u2019s why.\u201d</li> <li>Because of the danger of a paradox the lich that dwells at the site usually spends its time in the local umbra or shadowlands. However, it can and will set up traps for any visiting vampires.</li> <li>The lich is probably Ponticulus, owing to shenanigans on part of the Yith, and their agents the True Brujah.</li> </ul><br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I like this, thought I'd add a few more details.<br /> <br /> * Etrius DOES find this funny because he was always a pain about the Ceoris project. He told his subordinates to leave it be and they've (mostly) obeyed him because of it.<br /> * Tourists do disappear from time to time on the thing and are blamed on &quot;Romanian kidnappers&quot; that are just one of those horror stories in the WOD.<br /> * &quot;Angel&quot; sightings are frequent at night around the place at the moonlight. These &quot;large birds&quot; by more credulous witnesses are also associated with cattle mutilations and sometimes mangled bodies that look like someone dropped an anvil on them.<br /> * Tremere do ocassionally try to arrange private tours at night or people who don't realize how dangerous it is. This quest for artifacts or to reclaim the place is basically a suicide mission or snipe hunt that amounts to the same thing.<br /> * The ghost of the original Ceoris spirit has since become an incredibly powerful Specter who is surprisingly docile about regular human beings but lashes out at Tremere or their servants in a way that is fairly Silent Hill-esque. The spirits of hundreds of other workers, Tremere victims, and worse are all there. They remain almost entirely inactive during the day, though.<br /> * The Giovanni have considered trying to use the place for their plan to bring about the Final Nights. The few agents who have gone and looked around have all returned with a, &quot;Nope, nope.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 12-14-2019, 08:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-14T08:36:05-08:00","id":1354890,"title":"","content":"I don't think there are any gargoyles left at Ceoris. I think all they gargoyles are hanging out at a castle put on top of a skyscraper in Manhattan by a scheming billionaire. But having gargoyles sleep under the water has possibilities.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","c